---
import { v2ReleaseNotesUrl, v2SupportUrl } from "../../../lib/v2Links";
---

<section class="sec apps-next" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  <div class="wrap apps-next__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-num">06</span>
        Future tools
      </p>
      <h2 id="next-title" class="sec-title">Mythic stays first.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">
        More table tools are planned, but this page stays focused on the
        available Mythic apps. Public updates land in release notes when the
        next product is ready to talk about clearly.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="apps-next__panel">
      <p>
        Release notes, support conversations, Discord, and the feature board
        help show what is being considered, planned, fixed, or improved.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={v2SupportUrl}>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Support
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={v2ReleaseNotesUrl}>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Release notes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
